# IdleQuest content lookup (spawn / loot truth)

When the user is on **IdleQuest** (or asks to confirm a named / drop against server data), prefer [brynnb/idlequest-content](https://github.com/brynnb/idlequest-content) over P99 wiki alone. Wiki is still useful for lore and classic intent; **loot table rows in that repo are what the browser game uses**.

## How to check (no full clone required every time)

Sparse-clone the tables you need into a temp dir:

```powershell
$tmp = Join-Path $env:TEMP "idlequest-content-lookup"
git clone --depth 1 --filter=blob:none --sparse https://github.com/brynnb/idlequest-content.git $tmp
Set-Location $tmp
git sparse-checkout set data/npc_types data/items data/spawn2 data/spawnentry data/spawngroup data/loottable data/loottable_entries data/lootdrop data/lootdrop_entries data/zone
```

Data is hex-sharded `*.ndjson` (one JSON object per line). Names use underscores (`Skeletal_Procurator`); `#` prefixes are common for nameds.

## Join path (from their README)

```
zone.short_name -> spawn2.zone
spawn2.spawngroupID -> spawnentry.spawngroupID
spawnentry.npcID -> npc_types.id
npc_types.loottable_id -> loottable_entries.loottable_id
loottable_entries.lootdrop_id -> lootdrop_entries.lootdrop_id
lootdrop_entries.item_id -> items.id
```

Howling Stones short name: **`charasis`**.

## Practical grep order

1. **Item** — `Select-String data/items/*.ndjson -Pattern '"Name":"Mask of Obtenebration"'` → note `id`, stats (`ac`, `aagi`, `classes`, …).
2. **Who drops it** — `'"item_id":<id>,'` in `data/lootdrop_entries/` → `lootdrop_id` + `chance`.
3. **Which loot tables** — that `lootdrop_id` in `data/loottable_entries/` → `loottable_id`.
4. **Which NPCs** — `'"loottable_id":<id>,'` in `data/npc_types/` → `name`, `level`, `id`.
5. **Where they spawn** — `'"npcID":<id>,'` in `data/spawnentry/` → `spawngroupID` / `chance`; then that group in `data/spawn2/` filtered to `zone == "charasis"` for `y,x,z` (EQ often listed as y, x).

## Known IdleQuest ≠ P99 wiki gotcha

- **Enshrouded Veil**: P99 attributes to Embalming Fluid. IdleQuest puts Fingerbone Hoop / Hand of the Reaper on `#Embalming_Fluid`, and Veil as a **tiny % on multiple HS trash loottables** (sepulcher / helot / mortiferous golem / bottomless devourer / pulsating bile, etc.).
- **Mask of Obtenebration**: IdleQuest `#Skeletal_Procurator` west last room (~−90, 675) — confirmed.
- **Mask of Wurms**: IdleQuest `a_crypt_wurm` on north spots with Bile Sentinel (~239, 138 / 387, 80) — confirmed.

When documenting LustreDamus EverQuest samples for IdleQuest players, note server divergences in the zone intro or the Notes cell rather than silently following wiki-only attributions.
